{
  "an3.20:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 3.20 ",
  "an3.20:0.2": "2. The Chariot-Maker ",
  "an3.20:0.3": "A Shopkeeper (2nd) ",
  "an3.20:1.1": "“Mendicants, a shopkeeper who has three factors soon acquires great and abundant wealth. ",
  "an3.20:1.2": "What three? ",
  "an3.20:1.3": "It’s when a shopkeeper sees clearly, is indefatigable, and has supporters. ",
  "an3.20:1.4": "And how does a shopkeeper see clearly? ",
  "an3.20:1.5": "It’s when a shopkeeper knows of a product: ",
  "an3.20:1.6": "‘This product is bought at this price and is selling at this price. With this much investment, it’ll bring this much profit.’ ",
  "an3.20:1.7": "That’s how a shopkeeper sees clearly. ",
  "an3.20:2.1": "And how is a shopkeeper indefatigable? ",
  "an3.20:2.2": "It’s when a shopkeeper is skilled in buying and selling products. ",
  "an3.20:2.3": "That’s how a shopkeeper is indefatigable. ",
  "an3.20:3.1": "And how does a shopkeeper have supporters? ",
  "an3.20:3.2": "It’s when rich, affluent, and wealthy householders or householders’ children know of him: ",
  "an3.20:3.3": "‘This good shopkeeper sees clearly and is indefatigable. They are capable of providing for their wives and children, and paying us back from time to time.’ ",
  "an3.20:3.4": "They deposit money with the shopkeeper, saying: ",
  "an3.20:3.5": "‘With this, my good shopkeeper, earn money to provide for your wives and children, and pay us back from time to time.’ ",
  "an3.20:3.6": "That’s how a shopkeeper has support